<section class="c-section" id="faq">
  <div class="c-wrap c-faq-grid">
    <div class="c-head c-reveal" style="margin:0">
      <p class="c-eyebrow">Questions</p>
      <h2>Good to know.</h2>
      <p>Still curious? Reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@clayo.com">hello@clayo.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="c-faq c-reveal">
      <details open>
        <summary>How long does the battery last?</summary>
        <p>Around 2–3 hours per charge depending on heat level and massage mode. A full recharge over USB-C takes about 2 hours.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I wear it on my lower back?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Slide the pad around the strap to sit over your lower back — many people use it there for period-related back ache.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Is it safe to fall asleep wearing it?</summary>
        <p>The belt switches off automatically after a set time. We still recommend starting on a lower level and always wearing it over a thin layer of clothing.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I wash it?</summary>
        <p>The strap detaches and can be hand-washed. Wipe the heating unit with a damp cloth — don't submerge it.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What if it's not for me?</summary>
        <p>Try it for 60 nights. If it doesn't earn a place in your routine, send it back for a full refund.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

